Caelza M4 phase 2a: the Memory page.

Mounts the gateway's /api/mind routes (crates/caelza-gateway/src/api_mind.rs,
an overlay file) that proxy the xanima brain service with the host-side
tokens, and wires the dashboard's Memory page (web/src/pages/Memory.tsx,
overlay) into the lazy page registry, the router (/memory was a redirect to
the dashboard's Memories tab) and the sidebar's Home group. Applied after the
rename, the overlay and patches 0001 and 0002; regenerate with the same
`diff -u` when the upstream pin moves.

--- a/crates/caelza-gateway/src/lib.rs
+++ b/crates/caelza-gateway/src/lib.rs
@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@
 pub mod api_browse;
 pub mod api_config;
 pub mod api_logs;
+pub mod api_mind;
 pub mod api_oidc;
 pub mod api_pairing;
